From e0be55a25d03f03a7077d3f48de17dbb12f66c23 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kernel-experiments <kernel-experiments@localhost>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 08:27:32 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] inkling-turing: NVFP4 MMQ 128-wide K tile (NVFP4H layout), 2
 blocks/SM for J<=48, bit-exact

Halves the x tile (84 -> 44 ints/row) so two 256-thread blocks fit per SM; registers 138 -> 108-114 without spills;
K=1152 down projections no longer pad to 1280. Same accumulation order as the 256-wide loop.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/mmq-config-ampere.cuh | 32 ++++++++++----------
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/mmq-load-tiles.cuh    |  4 +--
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/mmq-vec-dot.cuh       |  2 +-
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/mmq.cuh               | 38 ++++++++++++++++++++++--
 4 files changed, 55 insertions(+), 21 deletions(-)

